  "id": "de-lange-syndrome",
  "term": "de Lange syndrome",
  "definition": "De Lange syndrome is a biological syndrome involving slowed growth, short stature, major intellectual disability, and a distinctive pattern of physical features affecting the head, face, neck, body hair, and hands. It can occur sporadically or be linked to autosomal dominant inheritance or duplication of part of chromosome 3.",
